OL,3,GNEWSAHope for stranded canal boats with
OL,4,Atunnel repair plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA temporary repair could allow stranded
OL,7,Fcanal boats to move again after a road
OL,8,Ftunnel over the waterway was damaged
OL,9,Fduring roadworks.
OL,11,FThe damage happened at the 200-year-old
OL,12,Ftunnel on the Kennet and Avon Canal in
OL,13,FBath, beneath the A36 Beckford Road.
OL,15,FBath and North East Somerset Council is
OL,16,Fproposing a "temporary shield" to let
OL,17,Fboats pass safely while a permanent
OL,18,Frepair is designed.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
