OL,3,GNEWSAHope for stranded canal boats with
OL,4,Atunnel repair plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Canal and River Trust said the
OL,7,Fdesign was being worked on and the
OL,8,Fcanal section and towpath would "remain
OL,9,Fclosed until further notice".
